// From tests/inductive-declarations.test.mjs: Second review: types are
// checked before reduction, level redexes reduce, telescopes substitute at
// once. The redex's argument U0 is not a UNat: the kernel sees it before
// reduction drops it.

import unat;

inductive N {
  zero;
  succ(n : N);
}

// Error: E606: Type mismatch: found U1, expected UNat.
inductive Discarded {
  discarded(x : (fun (n : UNat) => UNat)(U0));
}

inductive Level {
  b;
  c : (fun (U < UU0) => Level)(U0);
  d(x : (fun (U < UU0) => UNat)(U0));
}
